   "id": "428af9ac-39c4-4e54-b8f4-1eca064c7c67",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "# Customer Churn Prediction & Retention Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "**Internship:** VEDA AI & ML Internship  \n",
    "**Intern:** Divakar R  \n",
    "**Day:** 38 of 45  \n",
    "**Project Day:** 3 of 4\n",
    "\n",
    "## Objective\n",
    "Develop a machine learning system to predict whether a customer is likely to leave a subscription-based service. Analyze churn patterns, compare classification models, identify important features, and recommend practical retention strategies.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Technologies\n",
    "- Python\n",
    "- Pandas and NumPy\n",
    "- Matplotlib and Seaborn\n",
    "- Scikit-learn\n",
    "- Jupyter Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "## Deliverables\n",
    "1. Data cleaning and exploratory data analysis\n",
    "2. Feature engineering and categorical encoding\n",
    "3. Three classification models\n",
    "4. Model comparison and evaluation\n",
    "5. Confusion matrix and classification report\n",
    "6. ROC-AUC and feature importance\n",
    "7. Customer churn risk prediction function\n",
    "8. Business-focused retention recommendations\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 48,
   "id": "b6a16986-e1c3-4232-985a-e6058e36f314",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "All libraries imported successfully.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")\n",
    "\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "from IPython.display import display\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "from sklearn.compose import ColumnTransformer\n",
    "from sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\n",
    "from sklearn.preprocessing import OneHotEncoder, StandardScaler\n",
    "from sklearn.impute import SimpleImputer\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n",
    "from sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier\n",
    "from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import (\n",
    "    accuracy_score,\n",
    "    precision_score,\n",
    "    recall_score,\n",
    "    f1_score,\n",
    "    roc_auc_score,\n",
    "    confusion_matrix,\n",
    "    classification_report,\n",
    "    RocCurveDisplay\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "RANDOM_STATE = 42\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"All libraries imported successfully.\")\n"
   ]
  },
