  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "87977c6c-36bb-4eb4-aee4-8cefa87a4230",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "## Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "The Customer Churn Prediction and Retention Analysis project\n",
    "demonstrates an end-to-end machine learning workflow for a\n",
    "subscription-based telecom business.\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset was cleaned and explored to understand customer\n",
    "characteristics and observed churn patterns. Logistic Regression,\n",
    "Decision Tree, and Random Forest classifiers were trained and\n",
    "evaluated using accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, confusion\n",
    "matrices, and ROC-AUC.\n",
    "\n",
    "The selected model was compared using test-set performance.\n",
    "Feature importance analysis was used to identify influential\n",
    "predictors, while customer segment analysis supported the\n",
    "development of targeted retention recommendations.\n",
    "\n",
    "The resulting prediction function estimates the probability\n",
    "of churn for a customer with the required input features.\n",
    "\n",
    "Model results describe performance on this dataset and do not\n",
    "guarantee future customer behavior. Retention strategies should\n",
    "be validated using real campaign outcomes.\n"
   ]
  },
